  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1,500eb (Very Expensive)<br>\n<strong>Enhances:</strong> Grafted Muscle and Bone Lace<br>\n<strong>Option Slots:</strong> 0 (Cyberware Enhancement)</p>\n<p>Enhances Grafted Muscle and Bone Lace, which then counts as Borgware for Maximum Humanity Loss. The user's BODY counts as 1 higher for Brawling/Martial Arts damage and for BODY requirements on weapons and items, such as whether a weapon can be wielded one-handed. It doesn't stack with Ol' Donkey's primary effect. With two installations of Endo-Lace Bracing, BODY also counts as 3 higher for BODY checks to move, lift, or manhandle heavy objects.</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Cyberware &gt; Internal Body Cyberware).</em></p>"
